{"speciesId":782,"names":{"fr":"Bébécaille","es":"Jangmo-o","en":"Jangmo-o","ja":"ジャラコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il communique ses sentiments en frottant ses écailles. Les montagnes peuplées de Bébécaille bruissent d’un écho métallique."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Comunica sus sentimientos haciendo sonar sus escamas. El ruido metálico producido reverbera en las altas montañas donde habita."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It expresses its feelings by smacking its scales. Metallic sounds echo through the tall mountains where Jangmo-o lives."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ウロコを 叩き 気持ちを 伝える。 ジャラコの 棲む 高山では 金属音が 木霊する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il vit dans les montagnes inhabitées. En affrontant d’autres Bébécaille, il grandit et se développe petit à petit."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Habita en montañas despobladas. Luchan entre ellos para fortalecerse poco a poco."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They live in mountains where no trace of humans can be detected. Jangmo-o grow little by little as they battle one another."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"人気の ない 山に 暮らす。 ジャラコ同士 戦いながら 少しずつ 成長 していく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il frotte violemment l’écaille de sa tête sur des pierres et sur le sol pour intimider ses ennemis ou pour communiquer avec ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Embiste ferozmente contra las rocas o el suelo con la escama de su cabeza e intimida al rival. El sonido también le sirve para comunicarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It smacks the scales on its head against rocks or against the ground to frighten its opponents. It can also contact its friends with these noises."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"頭の ウロコで 岩や 地面を バシバシ 叩き 相手を 威嚇。 音で 仲間と 連絡も とる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il ne tourne jamais le dos à son adversaire en combat. Les guerriers d’autrefois s’en faisaient un compagnon, car ils appréciaient sa bravoure."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Combate sin dar nunca la espalda al enemigo. Los guerreros de la antigüedad admiraban su osadía y lo tomaban como compañero."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It will never show an enemy its back in battle. Ancient warriors liked Jangmo-o for its valiant disposition and made it one of their own."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"敵に 背中を 見せず 戦う。 勇敢な 性質から 古代の 戦士は 好んで 仲間に した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il apprend à se battre en entrechoquant l’écaille qu’il a sur la tête avec celle de ses congénères, ce qui renforce sa technique et son esprit."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aprende a luchar haciendo chocar la escama de su cabeza con la de sus congéneres. Así fortalece tanto la mente como sus movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"They learn to fight by smashing their head scales together. The dueling strengthens both their skills and their spirits."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頭の ウロコを 仲間同士で ぶつけ合い 戦い方を 学ぶ。 技と 気持ちが 鍛えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il communique avec ses congénères en faisant cliqueter ses écailles dures comme du métal."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se comunica con sus congéneres mediante los sonidos que produce al golpear sus escamas, duras como el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Jangmo-o strikes its scales to communicate with others of its kind. Its scales are actually fur that’s become as hard as metal."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体毛が 金属のように 硬く なった ウロコを 打ち鳴らして 仲間と コミュニケーションする。"}],"varieties":[{"id":782,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":